<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <h1 class="mb-4">Refund & Return Policy</h1>
            
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">1. Returns</h2>
                    <p>We accept returns within 30 days of the purchase date. To be eligible for a return, your item must be:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Unused and in the same condition as received</li>
                        <li>In its original packaging</li>
                        <li>Accompanied by the original receipt or proof of purchase</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">2. Return Process</h2>
                    <p>To initiate a return:</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Contact our customer service team</li>
                        <li>Provide your order number and reason for return</li>
                        <li>Follow the return instructions provided</li>
                        <li>Ship the item back to us</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">3. Refunds</h2>
                    <p>Once your return is received and inspected, we will:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Process your refund within 5-7 business days</li>
                        <li>Refund the original payment method</li>
                        <li>Send you an email notification when the refund is processed</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">4. Non-Returnable Items</h2>
                    <p>Certain items cannot be returned:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Gift cards</li>
                        <li>Downloadable software products</li>
                        <li>Personalized or custom-made items</li>
                        <li>Items marked as "final sale"</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">5. Damaged or Defective Items</h2>
                    <p>If you receive a damaged or defective item:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Contact us immediately</li>
                        <li>Provide photos of the damage or defect</li>
                        <li>We will arrange for a replacement or refund</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">6. Shipping Costs</h2>
                    <p>For returns due to our error:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>We will cover the return shipping costs</li>
                        <li>Provide a prepaid return shipping label</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For other returns:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Customer is responsible for return shipping costs</li>
                        <li>Original shipping costs are non-refundable</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">7. Exchanges</h2>
                    <p>We currently do not offer direct exchanges. To exchange an item:</p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Return the original item following our return process</li>
                        <li>Place a new order for the desired item</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h4 mb-3">8. Contact Us</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions about our Refund & Return Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:returns@shopsphere.com">returns@shopsphere.com</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %> 